**Reused evidence**
No reused items were materially applicable to 7B beyond general country-context priors, so no `REUSE_JSON` lines are used here.

**New evidence**
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"New Pak PM Says Will Step Down If \"Foreign Conspiracy\" Claim Proved","publisher":"NDTV","publication_date":"2022-04-11","url":"https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/new-pakistan-pm-shehbaz-sharif-says-will-step-down-if-imran-khans-foreign-conspiracy-claim-proved-2879523","claim":"After being elected prime minister, Shehbaz Sharif announced a parliamentary probe into the 'foreign conspiracy' claim and said he would resign if even a shred of evidence proved it.","locator":"lead paragraphs / quoted speech","source_type":"media","source_confidence":"medium_high","source_confidence_reason":"Direct report of a parliamentary speech with a specific conditional-resignation quote, but carried by a secondary outlet and attributed to an ANI feed.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Directly within the target year and at the start of Sharif's premiership.","ruler_attribution":"Direct: this is Sharif's own public statement in parliament.","contrary_evidence":["The claim concerned Khan's allegation rather than a completed integrity finding.","Later official review rejected the foreign-conspiracy allegation, so the statement reads as a willingness to submit to scrutiny rather than proof of the allegation."],"lenses":["7B.1","7B.2","7B.6","7B.8","7B.10"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"NAB failed to prove any case against me: Shehbaz","publisher":"Dawn","publication_date":"2022-06-12","url":"https://www.dawn.com/news/1694362","claim":"In court, Sharif said he did not own a single share in his sons' sugar business and said he had been implicated in baseless cases on political grounds.","locator":"court-hearing report / direct quote","source_type":"media","source_confidence":"medium_high","source_confidence_reason":"Contemporaneous legal-reporting article quoting the defendant's court statement and summarizing the hearing.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Within the target year and directly tied to an active corruption case against him.","ruler_attribution":"Direct: the quoted denial is Sharif's own statement in court.","contrary_evidence":["The statement is self-serving and not an independent finding.","The broader money-laundering and family-business allegations remained politically contested in 2022."],"lenses":["7B.1","7B.3","7B.6","7B.7","7B.8","7B.10"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Shehbaz, Imran’s spouses richer than husbands","publisher":"Dawn","publication_date":"2022-06-16","url":"https://www.dawn.com/news/amp/1695047","claim":"The Election Commission's asset statements showed Shehbaz Sharif had assets worth Rs104.21 million and liabilities of Rs141.78 million, including a London residence and a loan from his son.","locator":"asset-statement summary paragraph","source_type":"official","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"The article reproduces Election Commission asset filings, which are formal disclosures rather than rumor or allegation.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Within the target year, based on filed wealth statements for the relevant parliamentary year.","ruler_attribution":"Direct and self-reported: these are Sharif's own filed asset and liability declarations.","contrary_evidence":["Self-reported asset statements do not independently prove completeness or absence of hidden interests.","The declared loan from his son and overseas property show close family financial links that cut both ways for integrity analysis."],"lenses":["7B.3","7B.6","7B.8","7B.10"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"No money 'directly deposited' into bank accounts of Shehbaz, Hamza, FIA tells Lahore court","publisher":"Dawn","publication_date":"2022-10-11","url":"https://www.dawn.com/news/1714491","claim":"FIA counsel told the Lahore special court that no money was directly deposited or withdrawn from the bank accounts of Shehbaz Sharif or Hamza Shehbaz, and that the agency had no evidence of direct transfers into their accounts.","locator":"hearing summary / prosecutor remarks","source_type":"legal","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"The article reports prosecution statements made in open court in a live money-laundering hearing, which is highly probative even though reported through a newspaper.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Within the target year during the active 2022 money-laundering proceedings.","ruler_attribution":"Direct to Shehbaz and his son, with the court record focusing on their accounts and alleged benami transactions.","contrary_evidence":["The broader case still alleged indirect use of benami accounts and family-linked money flows.","A lack of direct deposit evidence does not by itself rule out all forms of indirect benefit or concealment."],"lenses":["7B.3","7B.4","7B.6","7B.7","7B.10"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"FIA failed to link Shehbaz, Hamza to benami accounts: judge","publisher":"Dawn","publication_date":"2022-10-14","url":"https://www.dawn.com/news/1714961","claim":"In the detailed verdict, the judge said FIA failed to prove Shehbaz Sharif and Hamza Shehbaz as beneficiaries of the benami accounts, found no nexus or beneficial interest, and said there was no probability of conviction.","locator":"detailed verdict summary","source_type":"legal","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"The article summarizes the court's detailed written judgment, including explicit findings on nexus and benefit.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Within the target year and directly relevant to the same case.","ruler_attribution":"Direct to Shehbaz and Hamza as the named beneficiaries/defendants in the case.","contrary_evidence":["This is one court's verdict in one case and does not prove the absence of every possible conflict of interest in 2022.","The prosecution had advanced serious allegations before the verdict was issued."],"lenses":["7B.3","7B.4","7B.6","7B.7","7B.10"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Pakistani court acquits PM, son in money laundering case","publisher":"Associated Press","publication_date":"2022-10-12","url":"https://keyt.com/news/2022/10/12/pakistani-court-acquits-pm-son-in-money-laundering-case/","claim":"A Pakistani court acquitted Prime Minister Shehbaz Sharif and his son Hamza of corruption and money-laundering charges filed in 2020.","locator":"lead paragraph","source_type":"legal","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Associated Press is reporting a court acquittal, which is a strong and well-bounded legal outcome even though the report itself is secondhand.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Within the target year, after the court resolved the 2020 case.","ruler_attribution":"Direct to Shehbaz and his son as the defendants acquitted by the court.","contrary_evidence":["The AP report notes the prosecutor was unavailable for comment and that the defense called the case politically motivated.","The acquittal resolves the cited charges, but it does not erase all surrounding corruption allegations from public debate."],"lenses":["7B.3","7B.4","7B.6","7B.7","7B.10"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Not accused of any wrongdoing: Daily Mail apologises to PM Shehbaz for false corruption allegation","publisher":"Dawn","publication_date":"2022-12-08","url":"https://www.dawn.com/news/1725318","claim":"Daily Mail apologized to Prime Minister Shehbaz Sharif, withdrew its corruption allegation, and removed the article that had accused him of stealing British foreign aid money.","locator":"lead paragraphs / apology report","source_type":"media","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"The article reports a public retraction and apology from the original publisher, which is a strong corrective signal even though it concerns an older accusation.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Published in the target year and directly relevant to Sharif's public integrity record.","ruler_attribution":"Direct to Shehbaz as the subject of the withdrawn allegation and apology.","contrary_evidence":["The apology concerns a 2019 article, so it is retrospective vindication rather than evidence of a 2022 affirmative act of honesty.","It does not by itself prove full integrity across all domains."],"lenses":["7B.1","7B.2","7B.6","7B.10"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Pakistan's new finance minister faces tight time frame to tackle crises","publisher":"Reuters","publication_date":"2022-04-20","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2022/04/20/us-pakistan-politics-financeminister","claim":"Shehbaz Sharif appointed economist and businessman Miftah Ismail as finance minister and tasked him with arresting the economic spiral and restarting IMF talks.","locator":"lead paragraph","source_type":"media","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Reuters reporting on a cabinet appointment and the stated rationale for the choice is strong evidence of a professional appointment decision.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Directly within the target year and early in Sharif's premiership.","ruler_attribution":"Direct: the appointment is attributed to Sharif as prime minister.","contrary_evidence":["The source also notes Ismail had a close relationship with Sharif, so the appointment is not purely technocratic.","A single professional appointment does not establish a generally merit-based cabinet."],"lenses":["7B.5","7B.9","7B.10"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Ishaq Dar appointed federal finance and revenue minister","publisher":"Dawn","publication_date":"2022-09-28","url":"https://www.dawn.com/news/amp/1712399","claim":"PML-N stalwart Ishaq Dar was nominated by Nawaz Sharif and Prime Minister Shehbaz Sharif during a meeting and then appointed finance minister on the prime minister's advice.","locator":"lead paragraph","source_type":"media","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Contemporaneous report of a senior cabinet appointment with named nominators and the official appointment basis.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Within the target year and directly tied to Sharif's cabinet decisions.","ruler_attribution":"Direct and close-network based: the appointment is attributed to Shehbaz Sharif and his family party leadership.","contrary_evidence":["Dar was a seasoned finance professional, so the appointment also had competence credentials.","The party-network nature of the decision still raises a favoritism concern even if the appointee was qualified."],"lenses":["7B.5","7B.9","7B.10"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Pakistan's new PM picks coalition cabinet after Khan ousted","publisher":"Reuters","publication_date":"2022-04-19","url":"https://thepeninsulaqatar.com/article/19/04/2022/pakistans-new-pm-picks-coalition-cabinet-after-khan-ousted","claim":"Sharif appointed a multi-party coalition cabinet made up of former rivals, and the cabinet included five women while Miftah Ismail was given the finance portfolio to stabilize the economy.","locator":"lead paragraph and cabinet summary","source_type":"media","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Reuters feed on the cabinet formation is reliable for the fact of a coalition cabinet and the named composition, though it is still a news report rather than an official gazette.","final_evidence_use":"context","period_fit":"Within the target year at the start of the Sharif government.","ruler_attribution":"Direct to Shehbaz Sharif as prime minister assembling the cabinet, though coalition bargaining constrained selection.","contrary_evidence":["Coalition composition is not the same as integrity, and some posts still reflected party bargaining.","This source is more context than proof of ethical restraint."],"lenses":["7B.5","7B.9"]}
